    {
      "slug": "seo-geo-theme/corporate-case-study",
      "viewport_width": 1200,
      "locales": {
        "en_US": {
          "title": "Corporate case study teaser",
          "description": "A factual case-study teaser that prompts for a real challenge, approach and result.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"surface\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|2xl\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|xl\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|2xl\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|xl\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-surface-background-color has-background\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Selected work</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} --><p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">Present a real project with verifiable context. Replace every prompt before publishing.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Challenge</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Describe the client or project situation without disclosing confidential information.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Approach</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Explain the work performed, the scope and the decisions that can be substantiated.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Result</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Add only outcomes you can verify and attribute to an appropriate source.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "title": "Avance de caso de éxito corporativo",
          "description": "Un avance factual de caso de éxito que pide un reto, enfoque y resultado reales.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"surface\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|2xl\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|xl\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|2xl\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|xl\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-surface-background-color has-background\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Proyectos seleccionados</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} --><p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">Presenta un proyecto real con contexto verificable. Sustituye cada indicación antes de publicar.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Reto</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Describe la situación del cliente o proyecto sin revelar información confidencial.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Enfoque</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Explica el trabajo realizado, el alcance y las decisiones que se puedan respaldar.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resultado</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Añade únicamente resultados que puedas verificar y atribuir a una fuente adecuada.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "seo-geo-theme/corporate-stats",
      "viewport_width": 1200,
      "locales": {
        "en_US": {
          "title": "Corporate verified metrics",
          "description": "A three-column metrics section that requires evidence-backed values.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key facts</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} --><p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">Use only current figures that you can verify. Add context or a source in the surrounding copy.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Metric label</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Add a verified value and explain what it measures.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Metric label</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Add a verified value and the period or population it refers to.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Metric label</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Add a verified value and enough context to avoid a misleading claim.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "title": "Métricas corporativas verificadas",
          "description": "Una sección de tres columnas para métricas que exige valores respaldados por evidencia.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Datos clave</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} --><p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">Usa solo cifras actuales que puedas verificar. Añade contexto o una fuente en el texto cercano.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nombre de la métrica</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Añade un valor verificado y explica qué mide.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nombre de la métrica</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Añade un valor verificado y el periodo o población a la que se refiere.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nombre de la métrica</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Añade un valor verificado y contexto suficiente para evitar una afirmación engañosa.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "seo-geo-theme/corporate-testimonials",
      "viewport_width": 1200,
      "locales": {
        "en_US": {
          "title": "Corporate testimonial placeholders",
          "description": "A testimonial section that requires real attributed quotes and permission.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"surface\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|2xl\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|xl\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|2xl\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|xl\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-surface-background-color has-background\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What clients say</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} --><p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">Replace these prompts with real quotes you are allowed to publish. Do not invent names, companies or endorsements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p>Add a verified client quote.</p><cite>Real name and role, with permission</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p>Add another verified client quote.</p><cite>Real name and role, with permission</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "title": "Marcadores de testimonios corporativos",
          "description": "Una sección de testimonios que exige citas reales, atribuidas y con permiso.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"surface\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|2xl\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|xl\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|2xl\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|xl\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-surface-background-color has-background\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Lo que dicen nuestros clientes</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"muted\"} --><p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color\">Sustituye estas indicaciones por citas reales que tengas permiso para publicar. No inventes nombres, empresas ni recomendaciones.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p>Añade una cita de cliente verificada.</p><cite>Nombre y cargo reales, con permiso</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p>Añade otra cita de cliente verificada.</p><cite>Nombre y cargo reales, con permiso</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "seo-geo-theme/corporate-native-hero",
      "viewport_width": 1440,
      "locales": {
        "en_US": {
          "title": "Corporate native hero support",
          "description": "A modern two-column hero support block that sits below the page-owned H1 and asks for one clear outcome, two useful actions and verifiable proof.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-hero\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"22rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide seo-geo-corporate-native-hero\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-hero__copy\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-native-hero__copy\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Replace with a concise category, audience or positioning line.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"xl\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-lead\"} --><p class=\"has-xl-font-size seo-geo-corporate-lead\">Explain the primary outcome in plain language. Keep this short enough to understand before scrolling.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-actions\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons seo-geo-corporate-actions\">\n<!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\">Primary action</a></div><!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\">See evidence</a></div><!-- /wp:button -->\n</div><!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-hero__proof\",\"backgroundColor\":\"surface\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-native-hero__proof has-surface-background-color has-background\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Proof, not decoration</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"xl\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-xl-font-size\">Give the visitor a reason to trust the next step</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:list --><ul><li>Add one verified capability or credential.</li><li>Add one real outcome, method or source.</li><li>Link the proof to the service or case study it supports.</li></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "title": "Apoyo de hero corporativo nativo",
          "description": "Un bloque moderno de dos columnas que acompaña al H1 de la página y pide un resultado claro, dos acciones útiles y prueba verificable.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-hero\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"22rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide seo-geo-corporate-native-hero\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-hero__copy\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-native-hero__copy\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Sustituye por una línea breve de categoría, audiencia o posicionamiento.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"xl\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-lead\"} --><p class=\"has-xl-font-size seo-geo-corporate-lead\">Explica el resultado principal con lenguaje claro. Debe entenderse antes de hacer scroll.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-actions\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons seo-geo-corporate-actions\">\n<!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\">Acción principal</a></div><!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\">Ver evidencias</a></div><!-- /wp:button -->\n</div><!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-hero__proof\",\"backgroundColor\":\"surface\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-native-hero__proof has-surface-background-color has-background\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Prueba, no decoración</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"xl\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-xl-font-size\">Da al visitante una razón para confiar en el siguiente paso</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:list --><ul><li>Añade una capacidad o credencial verificada.</li><li>Añade un resultado, método o fuente real.</li><li>Enlaza la evidencia con el servicio o caso que respalda.</li></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "seo-geo-theme/corporate-native-capabilities",
      "viewport_width": 1440,
      "locales": {
        "en_US": {
          "title": "Corporate native capabilities",
          "description": "A modern service/capability grid built for concise definitions, audience context and crawlable internal links.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-capabilities\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignwide seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-capabilities\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Capabilities</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"2xl\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-2-xl-font-size\">Make the offer easy to scan and easy to compare</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Group only meaningful services or capabilities. Each card should define the outcome, audience or problem clearly enough to stand on its own.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card-grid\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns seo-geo-corporate-card-grid\">\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card seo-geo-corporate-card--featured\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-card seo-geo-corporate-card--featured\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\">01</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Primary capability</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>State the outcome, who it is for and the concrete scope without marketing filler.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"#\">Explore this capability</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\">02</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Supporting capability</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Explain the second meaningful area and connect it to a dedicated page when one exists.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"#\">Explore this capability</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\">03</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Specialist capability</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Use the final card for a genuinely distinct service, method or specialist advantage.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"#\">Explore this capability</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</section><!-- /wp:group -->"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "title": "Capacidades corporativas nativas",
          "description": "Una cuadrícula moderna de servicios/capacidades para definiciones breves, contexto de audiencia y enlaces internos rastreables.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-capabilities\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignwide seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-capabilities\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Capacidades</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"2xl\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-2-xl-font-size\">Haz que la oferta sea fácil de explorar y comparar</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Agrupa solo servicios o capacidades con significado real. Cada tarjeta debe explicar el resultado, la audiencia o el problema con suficiente claridad para entenderse por sí sola.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card-grid\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns seo-geo-corporate-card-grid\">\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card seo-geo-corporate-card--featured\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-card seo-geo-corporate-card--featured\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\">01</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Capacidad principal</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Define el resultado, para quién es y el alcance concreto sin relleno comercial.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"#\">Explorar esta capacidad</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\">02</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Capacidad de apoyo</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Explica la segunda área relevante y enlázala con una página propia cuando exista.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"#\">Explorar esta capacidad</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-card__index\">03</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Capacidad especialista</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Usa la última tarjeta para un servicio, método o ventaja especialista realmente diferente.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"#\">Explorar esta capacidad</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</section><!-- /wp:group -->"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "seo-geo-theme/corporate-native-proof",
      "viewport_width": 1440,
      "locales": {
        "en_US": {
          "title": "Corporate native proof",
          "description": "An evidence-first proof band for real outcomes, credentials, methods or sources without fabricated metrics.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-proof\",\"backgroundColor\":\"contrast\",\"textColor\":\"base\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull seo-geo-corporate-native-proof has-base-color has-contrast-background-color has-text-color has-background\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-proof__inner\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide seo-geo-corporate-native-proof__inner\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Evidence</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"2xl\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-2-xl-font-size\">Support the decision with proof a visitor can understand</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-proof-grid\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns seo-geo-corporate-proof-grid\">\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"lg\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-lg-font-size\">Verified outcome</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Add a real result with enough context to understand what changed and how it was measured.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"lg\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-lg-font-size\">Method or capability</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Show a concrete methodology, certification, process or first-hand capability that supports the claim.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"lg\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-lg-font-size\">Source or attribution</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Identify the person, project, source or document that makes the evidence traceable when appropriate.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n</section><!-- /wp:group -->"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "title": "Prueba corporativa nativa",
          "description": "Una banda centrada en evidencias reales: resultados, credenciales, métodos o fuentes sin métricas inventadas.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-proof\",\"backgroundColor\":\"contrast\",\"textColor\":\"base\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull seo-geo-corporate-native-proof has-base-color has-contrast-background-color has-text-color has-background\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-proof__inner\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide seo-geo-corporate-native-proof__inner\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Evidencia</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"2xl\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-2-xl-font-size\">Respalda la decisión con pruebas que el visitante pueda entender</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-proof-grid\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns seo-geo-corporate-proof-grid\">\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"lg\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-lg-font-size\">Resultado verificado</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Añade un resultado real con contexto suficiente para entender qué cambió y cómo se midió.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"lg\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-lg-font-size\">Método o capacidad</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Muestra una metodología, certificación, proceso o experiencia directa que respalde la afirmación.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-proof-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"lg\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-lg-font-size\">Fuente o atribución</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Identifica a la persona, proyecto, fuente o documento que permita rastrear la evidencia cuando corresponda.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n</section><!-- /wp:group -->"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "seo-geo-theme/corporate-native-process",
      "viewport_width": 1440,
      "locales": {
        "en_US": {
          "title": "Corporate native process",
          "description": "A three-step process section focused on method, decisions and deliverables rather than decorative timelines.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-process\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignwide seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-process\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Method</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"2xl\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-2-xl-font-size\">Show how the work moves from question to outcome</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Replace generic process language with the real decisions, inputs and deliverables that help the client understand what working together involves.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-grid\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns seo-geo-corporate-process-grid\">\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\">01</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Understand</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Define the problem, audience, constraints, evidence and decision criteria.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\">02</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Build</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Explain the real work, checkpoints and collaboration required to deliver the solution.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\">03</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Improve</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Describe how outcomes are reviewed, measured and improved after the initial delivery.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</section><!-- /wp:group -->"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "title": "Proceso corporativo nativo",
          "description": "Una sección de proceso en tres pasos centrada en método, decisiones y entregables, no en líneas de tiempo decorativas.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-process\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignwide seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-process\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Método</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"2xl\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-2-xl-font-size\">Muestra cómo el trabajo pasa de la pregunta al resultado</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Sustituye el lenguaje genérico de procesos por decisiones, inputs y entregables reales que ayuden al cliente a entender cómo será trabajar juntos.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-grid\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns seo-geo-corporate-process-grid\">\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\">01</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Entender</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Define el problema, la audiencia, las restricciones, la evidencia y los criterios de decisión.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\">02</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Construir</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Explica el trabajo real, los puntos de control y la colaboración necesarios para entregar la solución.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column seo-geo-corporate-process-step\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-process-step__number\">03</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mejorar</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Describe cómo se revisan, miden y mejoran los resultados después de la entrega inicial.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column -->\n</div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n</section><!-- /wp:group -->"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "seo-geo-theme/corporate-native-insights",
