          "description": "A crawlable three-post insight grid that turns ongoing publishing into part of the Corporate design system.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-insights\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignwide seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-insights\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Insights</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"2xl\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-2-xl-font-size\">Turn ongoing publishing into useful expertise</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Show recent articles that answer real questions, support service topics and strengthen the site's internal knowledge graph.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:query {\"query\":{\"perPage\":3,\"pages\":0,\"offset\":0,\"postType\":\"post\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"orderBy\":\"date\",\"author\":\"\",\"search\":\"\",\"exclude\":[],\"sticky\":\"\",\"inherit\":false},\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-insights-query\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-query seo-geo-corporate-insights-query\"><!-- wp:post-template {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"columnCount\":3}} -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-insight-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-insight-card\">\n<!-- wp:post-date {\"fontSize\":\"sm\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:post-title {\"isLink\":true,\"level\":3} /-->\n<!-- wp:post-excerpt {\"moreText\":\"Read insight\",\"showMoreOnNewLine\":false,\"excerptLength\":24} /-->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- /wp:post-template -->\n<!-- wp:query-no-results --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Publish the first useful insight to populate this section.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- /wp:query-no-results -->\n</div><!-- /wp:query -->\n</section><!-- /wp:group -->"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "title": "Insights corporativos nativos",
          "description": "Una cuadrícula rastreable de tres artículos que integra la publicación continua dentro del sistema visual Corporate.",
          "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-insights\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignwide seo-geo-corporate-native-section seo-geo-corporate-native-insights\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-section-heading\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"seo-geo-corporate-eyebrow\">Insights</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"fontSize\":\"2xl\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-2-xl-font-size\">Convierte la publicación continua en experiencia útil</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Muestra artículos recientes que respondan preguntas reales, apoyen los temas de servicio y fortalezcan el grafo interno de conocimiento del sitio.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:query {\"query\":{\"perPage\":3,\"pages\":0,\"offset\":0,\"postType\":\"post\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"orderBy\":\"date\",\"author\":\"\",\"search\":\"\",\"exclude\":[],\"sticky\":\"\",\"inherit\":false},\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-insights-query\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-query seo-geo-corporate-insights-query\"><!-- wp:post-template {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"columnCount\":3}} -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"seo-geo-corporate-insight-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group seo-geo-corporate-insight-card\">\n<!-- wp:post-date {\"fontSize\":\"sm\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:post-title {\"isLink\":true,\"level\":3} /-->\n<!-- wp:post-excerpt {\"moreText\":\"Leer insight\",\"showMoreOnNewLine\":false,\"excerptLength\":24} /-->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- /wp:post-template -->\n<!-- wp:query-no-results --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Publica el primer insight útil para completar esta sección.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- /wp:query-no-results -->\n</div><!-- /wp:query -->\n</section><!-- /wp:group -->"
        }
